function filterComparisonOptions(options,query){const fold=s=>String(s).normalize("NFD").replace(/[\u0300-\u036f]/g,"").toLocaleLowerCase("de");const terms=fold(query).trim().split(/\s+/).filter(Boolean);return options.filter(([key,label])=>terms.every(t=>fold(key+" "+label).includes(t)));}
